      "observed": "DroidValidationEngine (sheet readiness and issues list) requires locomotion, >=1 appendage, processor and armor; the chargen droid builder requires locomotion, processor, >=1 appendage and resolved quotes but not armor; reconciliation notes the Store path does not require armor. A droid built legally in chargen/store shows 'not ready' on its sheet.",
